  "how": "Childcare is mostly bought privately. The state helps two ways: **Colorado Universal Preschool (UPK, 2023)**, free hours for every child in the year before kindergarten, and **CCCAP** (Colorado Child Care Assistance Program), a means-tested subsidy run by counties and about 70% federally funded.",
